<button onclick="showPopup('Key insight','The kilometre-long journey of each ray is irrelevant — only the microscopic leftover leg Δl = d·sinθ, cut off by a perpendicular right at the slits, decides whether P is bright or dark. Whole-number multiples of λ give constructive interference (bright); half-integer multiples give destructive interference (dark).')">Key insight</button>
